(7687933, 1258843, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, Lydia!  And I totally disagree with Willem!  If you have more than one award-worthy art piece in a series, how foolish to not showcase it in another competition.  And I am so thankful for the archival challenges.  It gives people an opportunity to compete with their best work instead of something with the time and seasonal restrictions of a 2-week window.  I wish they were all archival.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This is beautiful, Lydia!  And I totally disagree with Willem!  If you have more than one award-worthy art piece in a series, how foolish to not showcase it in another competition.  And I am so thankful for the archival challenges.  It gives people an opportunity to compete with their best work instead of something with the time and seasonal restrictions of a 2-week window.  I wish they were all archival. ', '2021-02-24 10:21:50.000000', NULL, 0),
